   "title": "gmlx nodes: install",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "These gmlx nodes run the image model on a gmlx server on your Mac (Apple Silicon, M3 or newer). FLUX.3 klein needs ComfyUI 0.41 or newer.\n\n1. Install gmlx: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/installation.html\n2. Put the nodes into ComfyUI, then restart ComfyUI:\n\n   gmlx comfyui install\n\n3. Download the model:\n\n   gmlx pull flux-3-klein\n\nPut reference-1.png and reference-2.png in ComfyUI's input folder, or pick other images in the Reference nodes.\n\nGuide: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/comfyui.html"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
